<urn:adk-prov:runs/data/60615dc860694615a9e99c987da6d9ab> a lcont:LLMResponse ;
    dcterms:title "response:LCIA_agent"^^xsd:string ;
    prov:value """Perfect! The LCIA has been completed successfully. Here's a summary of the results:

## LCIA Results for Octocrylene Production

**Functional Unit:** Octocrylene production (1 kg)  
**Foreground Database:** lcia_74268b26  
**Method Set:** EF v3.1 (Environmental Footprint v3.1)

### Impact Scores (21 Categories):

| Impact Category | Score | Unit |
|---|---|---|
| **Climate Change** | 3.985 | kg CO2-Eq |
| Climate Change: Fossil | 3.980 | kg CO2-Eq |
| Climate Change: Biogenic | 0.0025 | kg CO2-Eq |
| Climate Change: Land Use & LULUC | 0.0026 | kg CO2-Eq |
| **Ecotoxicity: Freshwater** | 23.75 | CTUe |
| Ecotoxicity: Freshwater (Inorganics) | 22.58 | CTUe |
| Ecotoxicity: Freshwater (Organics) | 1.165 | CTUe |
| **Energy Resources (Non-renewable)** | 89.21 | MJ |
| **Acidification** | 0.0145 | mol H+-Eq |
| **Eutrophication: Freshwater** | 0.000988 | kg P-Eq |
| **Eutrophication: Marine** | 0.00315 | kg N-Eq |
| **Eutrophication: Terrestrial** | 0.0343 | mol N-Eq |
| **Human Toxicity: Carcinogenic** | 1.06e-09 | CTUh |
| **Human Toxicity: Non-carcinogenic** | 2.71e-08 | CTUh |
| **Ionising Radiation** | 0.378 | kBq U235-Eq |
| **Land Use** | 8.251 | dimensionless |
| **Material Resources (Metals/Minerals)** | 2.55e-05 | kg Sb-Eq |
| **Ozone Depletion** | 1.59e-07 | kg CFC-11-Eq |
| **Particulate Matter Formation** | 1.23e-07 | disease incidence |
| **Photochemical Oxidant Formation** | 0.0197 | kg NMVOC-Eq |
| **Water Use** | 1.054 | m3 world Eq deprived |

### Key Findings:
- **Highest Impact:** Energy resources (89.21 MJ) and freshwater ecotoxicity (23.75 CTUe)
- **Significant Impacts:** Climate change (3.985 kg CO2-Eq) and fossil fuel depletion
- **Minor Impacts:** Human toxicity and ozone depletion are negligible
- The production process is energy-intensive and has notable ecotoxicity concerns, likely related to solvent use and electrical requirements"""^^xsd:string ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:adk-prov:runs/prompt/LCIA_agent_lcia_aad175bba084e075> ;
